-- Blind-login guard (hybrid AMD/NVIDIA laptops): if the greeter still held the iGPU at login, Hyprland comes up on
-- the dGPU with no monitor and just sits there (black screen). ~12s after start with still no monitor: end the
-- session so SDDM shows the greeter again (a second login works). Does nothing when a monitor exists.
-- Known false positive: logging in with the lid closed and no external monitor.
hl.on("hyprland.start", function()
    hl.exec_cmd(home .. "/.config/hypr/scripts/gits-blind-guard.sh")
end)
